      {
        "id": 41483,
        "name": "lynkfox",
        "username": "lynkfox",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-02T12:16:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"drstein\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/cab0a1/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> drstein:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;So as far as I see it, it should be given the same treatment as other rewards, right? Well, my hope is that you do the opposite: if you reprint ambuscade, please reprint the other kickstarter-limted cards as well :)&nbsp;By the way, as for the unlimited run: how about making the same card with a different image? It is definitely easy to identify them, and it will also provide a little something for those that have the old promo version <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I think his statement was pretty clear - They will always reprint and re run Unity and Ambuscade (and by that same vein of thought, the Villian and Hero decks in the Shattered Timelines Stretch Rewards if we make them) because they are full new unique deck contents, not just a different way to play an existing hero. The 'New Environment' deck may fall under this too, from the stretch rewards.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>My thought is tho, if we don't make the stretch for the new hero deck, where will we see it? Will it replace another in a future expansion, or will it be released on its own later?</p>",
        "post_number": 35,
        "post_type": 1,
